runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:2:Per variant: metric means over all 64 test episodes (each episode tested once per seed; seed-averaged).
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:8:R = collections.defaultdict(dict)          # (variant, seed) -> episode -> record
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:11:    R[(r["variant"], r["seed"])].update(r["episodes"])
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:13:seeds = sorted({s for _, s in R})
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:15:print(f"variants {variants} seeds {seeds} episodes {len(eps)}")
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:18:    """seed-averaged (sum_correct, n) for an episode → allows event pooling."""
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:20:    for s in seeds:
runs/abl_allactor/summarize.py:26:    return num / len(seeds), den / len(seeds)
