     3	# ray-cast occlusion-aware candidates; OPENING=attr v1 + HIRES=3; TAH + PGIF tempered/absent-hold; committed memory),
     4	# 90° closed-loop camera, towns Town05 ×4 + Town01/02/04 (Town03 / Town10HD held out for 1004 cross-map tests), TRAINING seeds 97000–97104 (disjoint from dev 91000–19 / 93000–659, opening-classifier
     5	# 96000–96279 and test 95000+). The policy logs per S2 tick {crop-DINO feats, pos, aidx, tidx (GT only as the label)} to
     6	# runs/tah_v90/dag_v2/tahdag_<container>_epNNNN.pt (same schema as train/tah_cache.py).
