     3	Arms are read from eval_out/paper_it_<name>.json, else merged from the watchdog parts paper_it_<name>_p*.json[.partial]
     4	(or a single .partial) → works on running arms too (n is printed; verdicts on partial n are provisional).
     5	  python iter_gate.py [--json eval_out/iter_gate.json]"""
