    19	    return 1 - sum(bn[k] * nd[k] for k in nd if k in bn) / t if t else float("nan")
    20	
    21	
    22	# correct-lock ratio, three definitions (they differ ONLY for trackers that abstain, e.g. DAM4SAM loses its mask):
    23	#   correct   = committed identity == target (abstention holds the last commitment) — SAME notion of lock as longC /
    24	#               longW → primary; correct_l = 1 − mis_follow_inst (abstention counted as CORRECT; the metric used up to
    25	#               1003 and in the pre-registration); correct_s = strict (abstention counted as WRONG).
